{
  "id": "RAW_5e63c3c7a4",
  "title": "智能体年均增长超一倍，百度智能云给智能体配了套新底座",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MTQ4NjQzMw==&mid=2652813116&idx=1&sn=2f2a774cdded9f60be2e98db87e5acfe",
  "date": "2026-10-31 21:56:00",
  "author": "智东西",
  "siteName": "智东西",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>杨京丽</span> <span>2026-10-31 21:56</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144659_f424a73.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px;white-space: normal;\">\n   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 150\" style=\"display:block;\" overflow=\"hidden\">\n    <image href=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dUMUxwSibzuxrsXYvED9aCH3rktqiaQvJHVficLjR9ibPrMUkT9s4WUcDO9AzBlVeTuIjMPtj3RRvzwPppKXVQFCwMl7QWwSMBZt5c6uGgGvp0o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" width=\"680\" height=\"150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n     <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0,0; 0,0; -680,0; -680,0\" keyTimes=\"0; 0.5; 0.5; 1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"discrete\"></animateTransform>\n    </image>\n    <image href=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dUMUxwSibzuwFrJian8EEAj0kpzIp54WnOibdBZyib861hLibMeGkCaVe0F5vJiceGia07TA3PdibWyWlgE571tSiaXGQM99QzV06p3gph2pBXPGFibiao/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" width=\"680\" height=\"150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" transform=\"translate(680, 0)\">\n     <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"680,0; 680,0; 0,0; 0,0\" keyTimes=\"0; 0.5; 0.5; 1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"discrete\"></animateTransform>\n    </image>\n   </svg>\n   <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.42592592592592593\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144700_46ae248.png\"></span>\n  </p>\n  <div style=\"margin: 15px 8px 35px;\">\n   <p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;line-height: normal;font-size: 15px;padding: 0 10px;border-left: 3.5px solid #00b0ec;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">国产云厂商要把智能体“焊”在产业一线。</span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 8px 7.5px;white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-align: right;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">作者 | &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"display: inline-block;width: 63px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\">杨京丽</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 8px 35px;white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-align: right;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">编辑 | &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"display: inline-block;width: 63px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\">李水青</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">智能体的规模正在快速扩张。IDC预测，到2030年，全球活跃Agent数量将达到</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">22.16亿个</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，年复合增长率达到</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">139%</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，年均增长超1倍。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">各类智能体也在密集涌现，热度一路走高。从编程、办公到个人助手，从消费端到企业端，智能体正快速进入各个场景，成为今年AI落地的重点方向。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">与热度同步攀升的，是Token（词元）的消耗量。国家数据局披露，到今年3月，我国日均Token调用量已超过</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">140万亿</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，较2024年初增长</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">1000多倍</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">；中国信通院的监测则显示，到今年6月，这一数字已达</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">500万亿</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。如此庞大的调用量说明，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">智能体已经走出概念演示，开始承接大量真实任务</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些被高频调用的智能体，大多集中在通用能力和高频场景。还有一条路线值得单独拿出来看——</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">产业智能体</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。通用智能体比拼的是场景覆盖和调用频次，产业智能体则直接扎进社区治理、工厂车间、园区和门店这些业务现场，解决琐碎复杂的现实问题和日常事务。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这正是百度智能云蹚出的一条路子。在10月29日于武汉举行的百度智能云超级智能体大会上，从社区治理、园区运营、制造生产到门店管理，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">各类场景都涌现出百度智能体落地应用的实际案例</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">：它可以根据居民诉求自动生成治理工单，把群众的需求变成可追踪、可闭环的处理流程；它还能将工厂老师傅的经验沉淀成可调用的技能，方便后续快速复用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.66640625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8Eyv4o4AcurTGXr5I4AV4mk6yYJTy5ndmicDibkX31PzsYicNPZhia6HyFeVoeG5Xgk6QicaSyb9hdAdMFQCtpL5E8219e6fMJPCVqX08uFB8p0A/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"562\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"160\" data-imgfileid=\"505329467\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144700_b3c73c0.jpeg\"></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">将这些实践连起来，不难看出百度智能体落地呈现出的几个特征：一是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">场景聚焦产业一线</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，治理、运营、生产、服务等环节均有实际落地案例。二是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">直面复杂需求</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，尤其是工业制造这类经验密集、流程冗长的领域，对智能体的执行能力要求更高；三是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">强调任务闭环</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，能够让需求有结果、经验可复用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">要让智能体在企业中长期、规模化地运行，需要先解决</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">资源供给、任务执行、数据连接和安全管理</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">这几道难题。百度智能云因此推出</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI Infra与Agent Infra双层基础设施</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，让智能体成为企业关键生产力。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">从个人助手到业务主力</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">智能体闯行业深水区</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近一年，智能体正从个人提效工具，走向企业核心业务场景，落地步伐逐步迈向深水区。会上，百度副总裁石清华称，百度搭子作为通用智能体，今年3月上线后，月活已达</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">千万级</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，环比</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">增长10倍以上</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，智能体正在快速向大众渗透。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在C端不断普及的同时，智能体也在企业业务场景释放产业价值。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">杭州调味品企业松鲜鲜接入百度搭子后，原本需要</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">两天</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">完成的数据汇总工作，可缩短至</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">3分钟</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。智能体展现出跨系统数据读取与业务洞察能力，开始连接企业内部系统，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">参与经营分析和业务判断</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">企业业务场景之外，百度搭子还深度参与基层治理。在武汉硚口，政企服务企业鸿海鑫基于百度搭子的基层治理项目已覆盖</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">100万人口、300位用户和40个真实场景</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。居民在网格群发布的信息，经智能体分析后可自动生成诉求工单，并推送至街道系统跟进处理。在复杂场景下，百度智能体具备</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">非结构化数据处理能力、自动化执行能力与跨系统协作能力</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">无论是企业增效还是基层治理，智能体的落地并非一蹴而就，其背后是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">一整套系统工程的重新构建</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。随着Agent在企业中的参与度不断提高，相关基础设施也需要同步升级。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度智能云技术委员会联席主席郑然在接受智东西采访时谈道，企业调用的已不只是一个大模型接口，想要让智能体深入业务，还需要云厂商提供两类支撑：一方面是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">开箱即用的Agent能力</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，帮助企业快速接入和试错；另一方面是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">支撑智能体长期运行的基础设施</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，包括运行环境、数据连接、安全管理和持续运维等。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">而这两类能力，正是百度智能云面向企业智能体落地所提供的底层支撑。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">智能体要长效</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">模型之后，要先补“运行底座”</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">要让智能体在企业中发挥长效价值，需要为它提供一个</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">安全稳定、价值可衡量的运行环境</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">首先，智能体需要调用工具和企业内部数据，一旦操作失误就可能引发数据泄露或系统崩溃，因而需要一个安全的执行环境，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">“沙箱”</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">可以让智能体在封闭环境内执行任务，避免波及其他系统。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">其次，大模型还具有</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">随机性</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，企业还需要知道智能体到底做了什么、花了多少成本、效果如何，这就要求基础设施具备</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">“可观测”能力</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，帮助企业看清Agent成本、定位问题，推动效果持续迭代。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Agent Infra的本质，正是把一次性的模型调用，变成一个可以</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">长期运行、可观测、可治理的任务系统</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。智能体部署完成后，真正困难的是让它在企业环境中稳定运行，并持续交付结果。要做到这一点，需要先了解智能体的底层技术形态。</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">成熟的云原生应用</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">能够按需启动，根据任务量弹性调整计算资源，通过标准化方式调用云上的计算、存储和网络资源，由平台持续完成部署、调度和运维。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">郑然告诉智东西，智能体本身也是一种云原生应用，现有云原生技术仍然是其运行基础。但智能体的资源需求更具弹性，运行中也在一定的不确定性，未来还可能以海量规模运行，因此</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">云原生基础设施需要进一步演进</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，以适应它的工作负载。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">随着智能体数量快速增长，基础设施还要支撑更大规模的协同运行，这对底层架构提出了更高的要求。这就意味着，Agent进入生产后，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">企业的核心缺口逐渐从模型转向运行底座</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">郑然称，</span><span leaf=\"\">企业如果从头建设Agent Infra，需要覆盖计算、存储、网络、云原生和大模型工程等多个技术领域，建设投入和持续维护成本都很高。云厂商则可以通过</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">上下游协同和规模化运营</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，把这些能力沉淀为</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">开箱即用、分层可组合的产品</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。企业可以根据自身所处阶段，灵活选择基础设施、Agent平台或开箱即用的智能体，快速验证想法并持续迭代。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度智能云的Agent Infra覆盖</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">沙箱、计算、网络、存储、可观测和安全</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">等能力。</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">沙箱</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">负责快速启动任务、隔离运行环境并保存任务状态，让智能体在安全边界内执行任务；</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">计算、网络和存储</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">则像“水电”一样，高效支撑任务执行、数据访问和上下文处理；</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">可观测能力</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">记录智能体的执行轨迹，帮助企业分析成本、效果和故障原因。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2852512155591572\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2468\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8Eyv4o4AcuruymM7g5P7WcpHxliauNeysoKWKUibBpPiaeFbYpgCQbDcZyr9bMwDIfTHbqafscDn8WC54E4ejvNBg2RBd0X40ElN1dWk8eP8go/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"562\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"246\" data-imgfileid=\"505329465\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144700_ad3c2ca.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">通过这些能力，智能体才能长期、稳定、安全地运行。在底层能力之上，百度智能云还进一步</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">降低了智能体调用的门槛</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。过去，云产品复杂的界面和繁琐的配置往往阻碍了智能体的自动化执行；为此，百度智能云专门针对Agent的调用习惯，深度</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">优化了云产品的交互界面和使用方式</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，让智能体能够像“调用本地文件”一样，更高效、直接地调度云上的计算、存储和网络资源。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">目前，百度智能云已在自有产品和客户项目中持续验证相关能力，为企业提供从资源供给、智能体运行到开发运营的完整支撑。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">Token需求爆发式增长</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI Infra需要提升资源效率</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Agent Infra把智能体的任务跑起来之后，背后还需要</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI Infra持续提供模型训练、推理和资源供给</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。随着智能体数量和调用规模增长，AI Infra面对的压力也在同步上升。IDC预测，这些智能体带来的推理需求将超过100吉瓦。智能体越多、任务链路越长，算力、存储、网络和能源投入就越高，云厂商需要同时</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">扩大资源供给</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，并</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">提高每单位资源的Token产出效率</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">郑然在采访中提到，智能体上下文长度不断提升，模型参数规模持续扩大，结构更加稀疏，后训练占比也在提升。这些变化对计算、存储、网络和推理效率提出了更高要求，基础设施也需要围绕模型训练与推理重新设计，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">提升长上下文场景下的数据访问和Token效率</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度智能云通过</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">百舸AI计算平台6.0</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，将AI计算平台从单纯提供算力，升级为能够协同基础设施、资源管理和工程能力的</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">“智能工厂”</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，更高效地支撑智能体的运行。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.275\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2560\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8Eyv4o4AcuqmFL1oy5fIdz6Ub2ZkPAv5wBXAQ8TZPAiatFz0TbrslHCCMySzWZ17w1ZhHIzBsEM6q4bpxY3Zxd2t3oGic2FrjpP0F5T2HHuWk/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"562\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"210\" data-imgfileid=\"505329466\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261031144700_958cb0e.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">智能体走入更多场景的背后，既需</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: normal;\">要</span>Agent Infra</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">承接智能体的任务执行、工具调用和运行管理，也需要</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI Infra</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">持续提升模型训练推理和资源供给效率。两者协同，才能让智能体在更长任务链路、更大规模的调用中保持稳定运行，并控制整体使用成本。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">04</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">结语：Agent进入生产现场</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">全新云底座稳住落地需求</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">智能体正在从个人工具变成企业业务系统中的执行单元。模型能力只有进入生产环节，才能转化为可以持续复用的产业价值。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">当前智能体在越来越多的场景中落地，不断催生新的需求，这种“新”也会带动芯片、光模块、存储等基础设施产业发展，催生新的应用场景和商业模式。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">对云厂商而言，竞争重点也从提供单一算力资源，扩展到支撑智能体长期运行的完整基础设施。AI Infra与Agent Infra的协同，正在成为Agent落地的重要路径。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-bottom: 12px;margin-top: -18px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_d76335a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2796296296296296\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border: 0.3px solid #d8d8d8;display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802231755_aa7bb61.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:22px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_5cf34da.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7064814814814815\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border: 0.3px solid #d8d8d8;display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_220898f.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_5cf34da.png\"></p>\n  <p class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"智东西\" data-alias=\"zhidxcom\" data-from=\"0\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z7ZD1WagSLg1QQZ9WhzKFpoX6M9OFR8lZIbyhXWlLeyDm8kcJHPOt2FibQeibbonAAYAPyaCwZ4Y0RborxHic3ryQ/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"智东西，AI产业新媒体，专注报道人工智能的前沿技术发展，和技术应用带来的千行百业产业变革。我们的slogan是：聚焦AI前沿 服务产业变革。\" data-id=\"MzA4MTQ4NjQzMw==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\" data-service_type=\"1\" data-verify_status=\"2\"></mp-common-profile></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "百度智能云推出 AI Infra 与 Agent Infra 双层基础设施，支撑智能体从个人助手走向企业业务主力，解决资源供给、任务执行、数据连接和安全管理难题，推动智能体在产业一线的规模化落地。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "百度智能云推出 AI Infra 与 Agent Infra 双层基础设施，支撑智能体从个人助手走向企业业务主力，解决资源供给、任务执行、数据连接和安全管理难题，推动智能体在产业一线的规模化落地。",
  "summary": "随着智能体数量爆发式增长，百度智能云构建了从底层资源到上层应用的完整支撑体系。AI Infra 通过百舸计算平台提升模型训练推理效率，Agent Infra 则提供沙箱、可观测和安全管理，确保智能体在企业环境中稳定运行。这些基础设施不仅支撑了百度搭子的千万级月活，也帮助松鲜鲜、鸿海鑫等企业将智能体融入核心业务流程。",
